# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the worst case: everything on, the gestures held, cross-FM and Snarl. Rendered by this branch and by main;
# a change that keeps the sound gives the same samples. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
pressure w0 0
pressure w1 0
pressure w2 0
pressure w3 0
pressure w4 0
pressure w5 0
pressure w6 0
pressure w7 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
set 76 100
set 77 100
set 52 100
set 53 100
set 68 50
set 61 90
set 63 80
set 78 100
set 79 100
set 98 60
set 62 50
set 66 50
set 64 3
set 94 5
set 44 1
set 1 85
set 22 85
set 10 100
set 31 100
set 19 30
set 40 30
set 42 2
key w12 down
key w14 down
key w15 down
wait 4000
wav worst-crossfm.wav
wait 10000
wavstop
set 42 3
wait 1000
wav worst-snarl.wav
wait 10000
wavstop
key w12 up
key w14 up
key w15 up
